BEHAVIOR build-request

DESCRIPTION
  Builds a minimal HTTP/1.1 POST request: the fixed prefix
  "POST / HTTP/1.1\r\n\r\n" (19 bytes) followed by the raw body bytes.
  The consumer extracts the body as everything after the blank line.

CONTRACT
  INPUT body bytes 65536
  INPUT body_length int 8
  OUTPUT request bytes 65536
  OUTPUT request_length int 8
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH 2d0207a2

IMPLEMENTATION
  STORE request 80 1 0
  STORE request 79 1 1
  STORE request 83 1 2
  STORE request 84 1 3
  STORE request 32 1 4
  STORE request 47 1 5
  STORE request 32 1 6
  STORE request 72 1 7
  STORE request 84 1 8
  STORE request 84 1 9
  STORE request 80 1 10
  STORE request 47 1 11
  STORE request 49 1 12
  STORE request 46 1 13
  STORE request 49 1 14
  STORE request 13 1 15
  STORE request 10 1 16
  STORE request 13 1 17
  STORE request 10 1 18

  i = ALLOC 8 int
  STORE i 0 8
  blen = LOAD body_length 8

  LABEL copy_loop
    idx = LOAD i 8
    done = IGE idx blen 8
    BRANCH done copy_done copy_byte

  LABEL copy_byte
    idx = LOAD i 8
    byte = LOAD body 1 idx
    dst = IADD idx 19 8
    STORE request byte 1 dst
    new_idx = IADD idx 1 8
    STORE i new_idx 8
    JUMP copy_loop

  LABEL copy_done
    total = IADD blen 19 8
    STORE request_length total 8
    FREE i
END
